@host = http://localhost:5042
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN_HERE

### ===== AUTH (spec 001) =====

### Login admin (seed): lay accessToken roi dan vao @token o tren
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@gymmaster.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Thong tin user hien tai
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== USERS — Admin Management (spec 002) =====

### Tao tai khoan (Admin) -> tra ve temporaryPassword
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Le Thi Staff",
  "email": "staff01@gymmaster.local",
  "phone": "0900000001",
  "role": "staff",
  "password": ""
}

### Danh sach + tim kiem + phan trang
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users?query=staff&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Loc theo role
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users?role=member
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Chi tiet 1 user
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cap nhat (doi ten / khoa tai khoan / doi role)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Le Thi Staff (updated)",
  "status": "locked"
}

### Xoa mem (soft-delete)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
